    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμι-τόνιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>semitone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philol.
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.21
			</span></i> M., al., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
