				2.11.2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>half the skein</i> or <i>bundle of gut</i> in a
			torsionengine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				68.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one of the two frames containing the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνος</span> in such an engine, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				90.4
			</span></i>.</div>
